                            Table "public.inbound_email_effects"
        Column         |           Type           | Collation | Nullable |      Default      
-----------------------+--------------------------+-----------+----------+-------------------
 tenant                | uuid                     |           | not null | 
 provider_id           | uuid                     |           | not null | 
 normalized_message_id | text                     |           | not null | 
 effect_type           | text                     |           | not null | 
 inbox_id              | uuid                     |           | not null | 
 entity_id             | uuid                     |           | not null | 
 ticket_id             | uuid                     |           | not null | 
 reconciled            | boolean                  |           | not null | false
 created_at            | timestamp with time zone |           | not null | CURRENT_TIMESTAMP
Indexes:
    "inbound_email_effects_pkey" PRIMARY KEY, btree (tenant, provider_id, normalized_message_id, effect_type)
    "inbound_email_effects_inbox_effect_unique" UNIQUE CONSTRAINT, btree (tenant, inbox_id, effect_type)
Check constraints:
    "inbound_email_effects_type_check" CHECK (effect_type = ANY (ARRAY['ticket'::text, 'comment'::text]))
Foreign-key constraints:
    "inbound_email_effects_tenant_inbox_id_foreign" FOREIGN KEY (tenant, inbox_id) REFERENCES inbound_email_inbox(tenant, inbox_id)

